WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:09.589
Meet CallUp, the job app built for civil and earthmoving crews. The office books and dispatches the work, and the crew runs their day from their phone.

00:11.140 --> 00:22.127
Admins start on the dashboard. Today's and tomorrow's jobs are up front, along with anything that needs attention, like rego, insurance, or unsigned safety documents.

00:23.520 --> 00:28.939
The dispatch board lays out the week by crew. Drag a job to another day, and it's rescheduled.

00:30.439 --> 00:36.177
Each job keeps the client, site address, purchase order, crew and notes together, with a full history.

00:37.677 --> 00:44.952
Quoting is three quick steps. Describe the job, pick the machines, add a labourer, and CallUp prices it from your own rates.

00:46.989 --> 00:53.176
On site, operators open their run sheet, start the job, and send stamped site photos to the office.

00:57.239 --> 01:01.634
Clocking on records the time and location, then asks which machine they're running.

01:07.677 --> 01:12.540
Daily pre-start checks are tapped through on the phone, and every result is kept on record.

01:17.552 --> 01:21.243
Staff can request leave straight from the app, and see when it's been approved.

01:26.552 --> 01:29.688
Expenses are claimed by snapping a photo of the receipt.

01:36.989 --> 01:40.978
SWMS are read and signed with a finger, and every signature is logged.

01:47.489 --> 01:51.221
Back in the office, leave and expense claims are approved in a tap.

01:56.364 --> 02:02.973
Compliance tracks rego, inspection certificates, servicing, and insurance, and flags anything coming due.

02:05.427 --> 02:10.334
Timesheets roll up by pay period, and download as a spreadsheet, ready for payroll.

02:14.833 --> 02:18.396
Invite your team by email, and give each person the right role.

02:22.208 --> 02:24.597
Team chat keeps everyone on the same page.

02:29.208 --> 02:34.285
Getting started takes a minute. Sign up for a fourteen day free trial. No card needed.

02:35.786 --> 02:43.615
CallUp is twenty dollars a month plus GST, including one person, and just five dollars a month for each extra staff member.

02:45.927 --> 02:49.056
Start your free trial at callupapp.com.au

